# Harvested RT kernel artifacts (large, board-specific — provide them locally).
# See kernel/README.md. Use Git LFS if you want them version-controlled.
# Board targets live in subdirectories (kernel/pi4/, kernel/cm5/, ...) — the
# trailing /** covers artifacts at any depth under kernel/, not just direct
# children, so a new board subdirectory is excluded without editing this file.
kernel/**/*.img
kernel/**/modules/
kernel/**/dtb/
kernel/**/overlays/
kernel/**/*.deb

# WiFi credentials baked into the image (secrets) — never committed.
# See wifi.env.example. If present, stage 07-wifi writes a NetworkManager profile.
wifi.env

# pi-gen is fetched on demand by build.sh (pinned) — never committed.
pi-gen/
